    "prompt": "Build a professional restaurant website for Free. Free AI website prompts ready to paste into Lovable, Bolt, Claude, and more Built by a professional web designer.\n\nTech stack: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion (motion/react) + shadcn/ui + lucide-react.\n\nRequirements:\n- Modern, responsive design optimized for all devices\n- Smooth animations and transitions using Framer Motion\n- Clean typography with a professional font pairing\n- Dark/light theme support\n- Accessible UI components following WCAG guidelines\n- SEO-friendly structure with proper meta tags\n- Fast loading with optimized images and code splitting\n\nSections to include:\n- Hero section with clear value proposition and CTA\n- Features/services section with icons and descriptions\n- About section with company story or team\n- Testimonials or social proof section\n- Pricing or product showcase (if applicable)\n- Contact form or call-to-action\n- Footer with links and social media\n\nDesign principles:\n- Consistent spacing and visual hierarchy\n- Subtle hover effects and micro-interactions\n- Professional color palette that matches the restaurant industry\n- Clean card-based layouts with proper shadows and borders"
