": \"Therapist Website Prompt — Warm Editorial Design for Lovable, Claude, Bolt and more\",\n  \"description\": \"A calm, editorial therapist website with a true split-screen hero, free session card, fees table, and DM Serif italic headlines. Paste into any AI builder.\",\n  \"image\": \"https://framerusercontent.com/images/IUg4AKP6iszTxuqJb239xNTyLM.webp?width=400&amp;height=564\",\n  \"url\": \"https://websiteprompts.ai/prompts/therapist\",\n  \"datePublished\": \"2026-07-11T18:02:25.445Z\",\n  \"dateModified\": \"2026-07-28T07:33:08.852Z\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\n    \"name\": \"Adam Sebesta\",\n    \"url\": \"https://websiteprompts.ai/about\"\n  },\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Websiteprompts.ai\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [\n    {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://websiteprompts.ai\"},\n    {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Prompts\", \"item\": \"https://websiteprompts.ai/prompts\"},\n    {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Therapist\", \"item\": \"https://websiteprompts.ai/prompts/therapist\"}\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What sections are in the therapist website prompt?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Navbar, Hero, About and Approach, Therapy Types or Issues Worked With, How It Works (first session, what to expect), Testimonials, FAQ, and Booking or Contact. The tone is warm, grounded, and client-centred.\"}\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does this work for a psychotherapist, counsellor, or CBT therapist?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — the modality and title are placeholder content. Update them before pasting to reflect your actual training, approach, and the language your clients are likely to use when searching.\"}\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does this work in Lovable?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — Lovable, Bolt, and v0 all handle it. The warm, calm aesthetic comes through well and the layout is straightforward enough that the AI produces a clean result on the first pass.\"}\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I update the therapeutic approach and session formats?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — the modality, session length, format (in-person vs online), and pricing are all placeholder content. Update them to reflect your actual practice before pasting or after generation.\"}\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script><!-- SnippetEnd: JAOIGEzXk --><!-- End of bodyEnd -->\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
